
Areamask {lon,lat} paths based on SVG paths at: /smartmet/share/textgendata/maps/sonera/

The SVG files in there are not real SVG (they are not XML and don't open in SVG editors
or web browsers). They are however valid SVG path constructs.

The script 'rajat.lua' converts their coordinates to Lua syntax, which can be precompiled
for added speed (but that shouldn't be necessary).

- AKa 1-Oct-2009

